    "description"      "Standalone server-side toolkit for PZ B42 Multiplayer: starter kit crate, ration fridge, dynamic radio events, library, infinite generator, fuel pump refill, and a welcome note. All logic ships inside the mod — no manual file drops to ~/Zomboid/Lua/ required."

    "changenote"       "0.4.3 — Deferred ISWorldObjectContextMenu.createMenu wrap installation to Events.OnGameStart so it survives load-order races with other client mods. Wrap is idempotent and logs install+filter events to console.txt for easier diagnosis. // 0.4.2 — Right-click on a non-owner's claimed vehicle shows NO menu at all. // 0.4.1 — Nested-container fix (bag-in-trunk). // 0.4.0 — Safe-zone vehicle-claim, damage protection, library Place Item, FuelPump min 500, abandoned-vehicle event fixes."

